{
  "_doc": [
    "The Gradient panel's stop-colour law (transcripts/GRADIENT.md: double-click a stop opens the colour picker, OK writes the colour to the stop; EYEDROPPER_BUTTON applies a picked colour to the selected stop). Row 198.",
    "set_stop_color(stops, index, color) -> (stops, index), or refused (expected: null) when index names no stop or color is not a #rrggbb hex string.",
    "A plain set: no re-sort, no midpoint reset, the index is unchanged; the colour is stored lowercase.",
    "edit_stop (stop_edit.json) still refuses field 'color': this is a separate law, not a third edit_stop field.",
    "Read by workspace_interpreter/tests/test_gradient_stop.py (reference), jas_dioxus/src/cross_language_test.rs and JasSwift/Tests/Panels/GradientStopCorpusTests.swift."
  ],
